Z||000004||Songman||05-06-2001||10:52 PM||||Thanks guys... I'll send that e-mail, George.<P>Nashville is in middle TN, but I have never seen the link for one in Eastern TN. Apparently no one else has either since the people over there are joining ours.. hehehe<P>I found a listing a long time ago for one in Thompson Station which is right outside Nashville. Tried mailing, e-mailing, and even left messages on someone's home answering machine. I guess when I said it was about a Fiero club they didn't call back. Leads me to think it is defunct. That's why we started this one a few months ago... Having lots of fun...<P>By the way... anyone offering club discounts on parts or services, let me know and I'll add them to our website. Will be adding vendor and club links there soon too, so send anything you want listed to tnfieros@home.com<P>Thanks.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 05-06-2001).]||||reg||1
